WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
This statue is made of marble.

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.250
But its marble was not always marble.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.030
Long ago, it was a different
rock, called limestone.

4
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.030
So what turned the
limestone into marble?

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.110
Did it melt?

6
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.570
To find out, you'll travel down
through the Earth's layers,

7
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.630
from the thin crust, through
the thick mantle, to the core.

8
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.930
You'll find out what
the air is made of.

9
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.610
Is it mostly oxygen?

10
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.190
Then you'll meet the
three families of rock,

11
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.750
and the slow cycle that
turns one type into another.

12
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.890
Your mission: explain how
limestone became marble.
